<title>JAPAN: Tanabe Industries -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tanabe Industries -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.09		vs	    5.34</p>
<p> Operating	  202    million	  vs	   72    million</p>
<p> Current	    250    million	  vs	   92    million</p>
<p> Net		  211    million	  vs	   54    million</p>
<p> EPS		   39.43 yen	  vs	   10.19 yen</p>
<p> Shares		5 million	  vs	   5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tanabe Industries Ltd designs and constructs a wide range of plant facilities.</p>
